  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forestry reforms ph 3 B</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skogsreformer fas 3 B</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fas 3 B mellan Ramboll Natura AB och Statliga kommitt&#xE9;n f&#xF6;r skog i Ukraina fokuserar p&#xE5; &quot;Uth&#xE5;llig skogsf&#xF6;rvaltning&quot;, &quot;Nationell skogspolicy inklusive skogslagstiftning och institutionell utveckling&quot;, samt &quot;Skogsutbildning och forskning&quot; och &#xE4;r planerad att sprida och skapa en f&#xF6;rst&#xE5;else f&#xF6;r behovet av att inf&#xF6;ra uth&#xE5;lligt skogsbruk i dess olika aspekter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 3 B between Ramboll Natura AB and the State Committee of Forestry of Ukraine focuses on &quot;Sustainable forest management&quot;, &quot;National forest policy including forest legislation and institu- tional development&quot;, and &quot;Forestry education and research&quot; and is planned to disseminate and establish an understanding for the need to introduce sustainable forestry in its various aspects.</narrative>
  </description>
